diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2348cf3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Changelog
+
+## Unreleased
+- **The app can no longer be shown inside another website's frame.** Every page and API response now
+  tells the browser not to let other sites frame it, not to guess file types, and to send only our
+  domain (not the full link) when someone follows a link out. This closes the clickjacking gap on the
+  payment page (security gap #5). A fuller content-security policy is a later change.
